  note: 'Tomorrowland: a shiny gunmetal robot cat with her own face (folded ears, amber eyes) and little wheels on her feet. On a glowing terminal pad she plugs in and takes over machines (walkways, flying cars, doors, cleanbots); Dive on the ground rolls her fast on her wheels, and boost ramps launch her.'
